R36S clone (r36sclone): the clone's additions to the shared build scripts.

build_r36sclone.sh applies this before the build, so these upstream files stay
exactly as spruceUI/dArkMoss has them in git and an upstream merge never
touches the clone's changes. When upstream changes a line this patch needs,
git apply fails at the start of the build: rebase the patch onto the new file
(see R36SCLONE.md, "Keeping up with upstream").

